      "page_end": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "smoothMin(a; 𝛾) =",
      "section_id": "sec:methods",
      "page_start": 17,
      "page_end": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑘=1 exp\u0000−𝛾−1(𝑅(𝑖, 𝑘) + 𝐸(𝑖, 𝑘))\u0001 ,",
      "section_id": "sec:methods",
      "page_start": 17,
      "page_end": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "on temporally ordered correspondences. The reverse matching probabilities 𝛽𝑟→𝑑∈ℝ𝑁×𝑇are computed",
      "section_id": "sec:methods",
      "page_start": 17,
      "page_end": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "𝜋𝑟→𝑑(𝑡) = arg max",
      "section_id": "sec:methods",
      "page_start": 17,
      "page_end": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "𝜋𝑑→𝑟(𝑡) = arg max",
      "section_id": "sec:methods",
      "page_start": 17,
      "page_end": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑡𝑖= 𝜋𝑑→𝑟\u0000𝜋𝑟→𝑑(𝑡) + 𝑖\u0001",
      "section_id": "sec:methods",
